the drift scan, and the rewriting repair refuses it typed with history_record_version_unsupported plus the upgrade step, instead of diagnosing corruption. (e) A reseed reports an explicit --normalize-provenance request. Declined with reason: ownership-aware health advice. Health judges the stream, not the caller's authority. Under strict ownership_enforcement the advised repair refuses typed with the --force override and still works for the assignee, and making previews enforce ownership would misclassify an owned stream as unbridgeable."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-21T12:39:42.209Z"}],"before_hash":"dcaf15fa35ab06c35579e91078f625dc80d7d0ebab6c97533c0d976a09709463","after_hash":"00fb48de6fb68416df766c952cb6f5861b9bcd57b592fe639f82404c950ac1e2","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"7e28e1df3cbdff155f5e5eabf2d4cc41e7c19c41d0c6a6389d7d771aa22514ba"}
